      "value": "@{58c6cbcffd04b1785f747b6c|full_name}: The main issues were with position, honestly it's likely related to the issues with various RPCs causing the video to restart like Temporal posted about here https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/1061-vrcsyncvideostream-pause-fast-forwardrewind-and-resync-rpcs-broken.\nIn my case the video player would usually just end up entirely locked up, tho it was extremely intermittent, the first couple times my client would be playing fine, but a handful in the lobby would be stuck, but in later testing mine wouldn't even start it.\nFor the users that it was playing for there wasn't any issues, as long as nobody triggered a RPC on the video player.",
