      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "Thank you for submitting feedback!\n\nSDK2 has been deprecated, so we won't be able to fix bugs related to SyncVideoStream. https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrc_syncvideostream#section-starter-guide\n\nIf you'd like to use the SDK3 for video players, please try the \"UdonSyncPlayer (AVPro)\" prefab, included in the SDK.",
